Then the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts CompareOnly
| Path                           |
| Expenses:Household:Auto        |
| Expenses:Household:Auto:Repair |

Scenario An alias set from the dialog is what it always was
Description The one thing the dialog could already do, stated here so that
\ adding the other four is seen not to have cost it.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path               | Type    | Placeholder |
| Expenses:Auto      | Expense | true        |
| Expenses:Auto:Fuel | Expense | false       |
When category settings changed : CategorySettings Vertical
